  "text": "Skip to content\n\nCOMPLIMENTARY SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $150\n\nHOME\nCATALOG\nCONTACT\nSartorial Atelier\n\nTHE EDIT / SARTORIAL 01\n\nForm in quiet movement\n\nSculptural layers and tactile materials, made in small series.\n\nDISCOVER THE COLLECTION\nEXPLORE LOOKBOOK\nNATURAL FIBRES / TRACEABLE ORIGIN\nMADE IN SMALL SERIES\nCUT AND FINISHED BY HAND\nDESIGNED TO GATHER CHARACTER\nNATURAL FIBRES / TRACEABLE ORIGIN\nMADE IN SMALL SERIES\nCUT AND FINISHED BY HAND\nDESIGNED TO GATHER CHARACTER\nPause editorial highlights\n\nCURATED EDIT / 02\n\nSelected forms for the season\n[01]\nNEW FORMS\n[02]\nPERMANENT COLLECTION\n[03]\nTAILORING\n\nSPOTLIGHT SELECTION\n\nCashmere Rib Crew\nRegular price\n$820.00\nFine Merino Turtleneck\nRegular price\n$380.00\nColumn Knit Dress\nRegular price\n$720.00\n01 / 03\nVIEW ALL NEW FORMS\n\nCAMPAIGN STUDY / LOOK 01\n\nObjects in quiet conversation\n\nMove through the composition and discover each piece.\n\n1\n2\n3\n4\n\nA study in proportion, texture and daily movement.\n\nSerra Coat\nRegular price\n$1,890.00\nSize: 36\n36\n38\n40\n42\nQuantity\nADD TO CART\nBUY IT NOW\nIn stock, ready to ship\n\nComplimentary express courier | Dispatched within 24 hours\n\nDouble-faced wool and cashmere, woven in Biella and tailored without lining for an effortless drape from the shoulder. Raglan sleeves and an unpleated waist let the volume shape itself in motion. Double-breasted closure with matching self-belt.\n\nSHOPPABLE CAPSULE / LOOK 03\n\nComplete the look\n\nChoose each piece, select its size and add the full composition at once.\n\nSoft architecture photographed in natural atelier light.\n\nSelect Nove Blazer\nNove Blazer\nChoose an option for Nove Blazer\n34\n36\n38\n40\n42\nRegular price\n$1,150.00\nSelect Silk Charmeuse Blouse\nSilk Charmeuse Blouse\nChoose an option for Silk Charmeuse Blouse\n34\n36\n38\n40\n42\nRegular price\n$520.00\nSelect Pleated Wide Trouser\nPleated Wide Trouser\nChoose an option for Pleated Wide Trouser\n34\n36\n38\n40\n42\nRegular price\n$580.00\n\nCAPSULE TOTAL\n\n3 of 3 items selected\n\n$2,250.00\nADD 3 PIECES TO BAG | $2,250.00\n\nTHE HAND AND THE MATERIAL / 03\n\n“\nObjects gain meaning through the hands that make them.\n\nEvery edge and finish records a decision made by an artisan.\n\nEXPLORE TAILORING\n\nMACRO STUDY / MATERIAL 07\n\nMATERIALS\nTraceable natural fibres from Biella & Como\n01\nORIGIN\nHandcrafted in Northern Italy\n02\nFINISH\nHand-rolled lapels and pick-stitching\n03\nSERIES\nNumbered editions of 25 pieces\n04\n\nPRIVATE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nNotes from the atelier\n\nNew objects, material studies and private previews, sent with restraint.\n\nEmail address\nSUBSCRIBE\nSartorial Atelier\n\nPRIVATE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nNotes from the studio\n\nNew objects, material studies and private previews, sent with restraint.\n\nEmail address\nSUBSCRIBE\nSearch\nRefund policy\nShipping policy\nPrivacy policy\nTerms of service\nContact information\nAccepted payment methods\n© 2026 Sartorial Atelier\nPowered by Shopify",
